      "id": "38e963772805-q1",
      "number": 1,
      "question": "Match the column A with column B. Column- A (Vitamin) Column-B (Source) i. Vitamin A a. Carrot, mango, papaya ii. Vitamin B b. Whole grain bread and nuts iii. Vitamin C c. Citrus fruits, red and green pepper iv. Vitamin D d. Egg yolk, soya product &#2325;&#2377;&#2354;&#2350; A &#2325;&#2379; &#2325;&#2377;&#2354;&#2350; B &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2369;&#2350;&#2375;&#2354;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404; &#2325;&#2377;&#2354;&#2350;- A (&#2357;&#2367;&#2335;&#2366;&#2350;&#2367;&#2344;) &#2325;&#2377;&#2354;&#2350;-B (&#2360;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2340;) i. &#2357;&#2367;&#2335;&#2366;&#2350;&#2367;&#2344; A a. &#2327;&#2366;&#2332;&#2352;, &#2310;&#2350;, &#2346;&#2346;&#2368;&#2340;&#2366; ii. &#2357;&#2367;&#2335;&#2366;&#2350;&#2367;&#2344; B b. &#2360;&#2366;&#2348;&#2369;&#2340; &#2309;&#2344;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2352;&#2379;&#2335;&#2368; &#2324;&#2352; &#2344;&#2335;&#2381;&#2360; iii. &#2357;&#2367;&#2335;&#2366;&#2350;&#2367;&#2344; C c. &#2326;&#2335;&#2381;&#2335;&#2375; &#2347;&#2354;, &#2354;&#2366;&#2354; &#2324;&#2352; &#2361;&#2352;&#2368; &#2350;&#2367;&#2352;&#2381;&#2330; iv. &#2357;&#2367;&#2335;&#2366;&#2350;&#2367;&#2344; D d. &#2309;&#2306;&#2337;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2332;&#2352;&#2381;&#2342;&#2368;, &#2360;&#2379;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2313;&#2340;&#2381;&#2346;&#2366;&#2342;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Match the column A with column B.</p><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;\"><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\"><b>Column- A (Vitamin)</b></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\"><b>Column-B (Source)</b></td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">i. Vitamin A</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">a. Carrot, mango, papaya</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">ii. Vitamin B</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">b. Whole grain bread and nuts</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">iii. Vitamin C</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">c. Citrus fruits, red and green pepper</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">iv. Vitamin D</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">d. Egg yolk, soya product</td></tr></table></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2325;&#2377;&#2354;&#2350; A &#2325;&#2379; &#2325;&#2377;&#2354;&#2350; B &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2369;&#2350;&#2375;&#2354;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;\"><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\"><b>&#2325;&#2377;&#2354;&#2350;- A (&#2357;&#2367;&#2335;&#2366;&#2350;&#2367;&#2344;)</b></td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\"><b>&#2325;&#2377;&#2354;&#2350;-B (&#2360;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2340;)</b></td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">i. &#2357;&#2367;&#2335;&#2366;&#2350;&#2367;&#2344; A</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">a. &#2327;&#2366;&#2332;&#2352;, &#2310;&#2350;, &#2346;&#2346;&#2368;&#2340;&#2366;</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">ii. &#2357;&#2367;&#2335;&#2366;&#2350;&#2367;&#2344; B</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">b. &#2360;&#2366;&#2348;&#2369;&#2340; &#2309;&#2344;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2352;&#2379;&#2335;&#2368; &#2324;&#2352; &#2344;&#2335;&#2381;&#2360;</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">iii. &#2357;&#2367;&#2335;&#2366;&#2350;&#2367;&#2344; C</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">c. &#2326;&#2335;&#2381;&#2335;&#2375; &#2347;&#2354;, &#2354;&#2366;&#2354; &#2324;&#2352; &#2361;&#2352;&#2368; &#2350;&#2367;&#2352;&#2381;&#2330;</td></tr><tr><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">iv. &#2357;&#2367;&#2335;&#2366;&#2350;&#2367;&#2344; D</td><td align=\"left\" style=\"border:1px solid black;padding:5px;\">d. &#2309;&#2306;&#2337;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2332;&#2352;&#2381;&#2342;&#2368;, &#2360;&#2379;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2313;&#2340;&#2381;&#2346;&#2366;&#2342;</td></tr></table></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "i - b, ii - a, iii - c, iv - d i - b, ii - a, iii - c, iv - d",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">i - b, ii - a, iii - c, iv - d</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">i - b, ii - a, iii - c, iv - d</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "i - c, ii - b, iii - d, iv - a i - c, ii - b, iii - d, iv - a",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">i - c, ii - b, iii - d, iv - a</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">i - c, ii - b, iii - d, iv - a</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "i - b, ii - c, iii - a, iv - d i - b, ii - c, iii - a, iv - d",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">i - b, ii - c, iii - a, iv - d</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">i - b, ii - c, iii - a, iv - d</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "i - a, ii - b, iii - c, iv - d i - a, ii - b, iii - c, iv - d",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">i - a, ii - b, iii - c, iv - d</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">i - a, ii - b, iii - c, iv - d</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>Vitamins are the vital nutrients, required in minute quantities to perform specific physiological and biochemical functions.</p><p>&bull; The sources of Vitamin A are - carrot, mango, papaya, leafy vegetables, fish liver oil, egg yolk, liver, and dairy products.</p><p>&bull; The sources of Vitamin B are - Whole grains, nuts, yeast, eggs, liver, sprouted pulses.</p><p>&bull; The sources of Vitamin C are - Leafy vegetables, sprouts, citrus fruits like goose berry (Amala) , lemon, and orange.</p><p>&bull; The sources of Vitamin D are - Egg, liver, dairy products, Fish, synthesized by the skin in sunlight.</p>",
