    {
      "id": "38e963772805-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "What is the name of the inflammatory condition that causes cracks, crusting and scaling at the corners of the mouth due to vitamin B2 deficiency? &#2313;&#2360; &#2360;&#2370;&#2332;&#2344; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2368; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2366; &#2344;&#2366;&#2350; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2379; &#2357;&#2367;&#2335;&#2366;&#2350;&#2367;&#2344; &#2348;&#2368;2 &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2350;&#2368; &#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2350;&#2369;&#2306;&#2361; &#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2346;&#2352; &#2342;&#2352;&#2366;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;, &#2346;&#2346;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; &#2324;&#2352; &#2360;&#2381;&#2325;&#2375;&#2354;&#2367;&#2306;&#2327; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2344;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What is the name of the inflammatory condition that causes cracks, crusting and scaling at the corners of the mouth due to vitamin B2 deficiency?</p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2313;&#2360; &#2360;&#2370;&#2332;&#2344; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2368; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2367;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2366; &#2344;&#2366;&#2350; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2379; &#2357;&#2367;&#2335;&#2366;&#2350;&#2367;&#2344; &#2348;&#2368;2 &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2350;&#2368; &#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2350;&#2369;&#2306;&#2361; &#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2346;&#2352; &#2342;&#2352;&#2366;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;, &#2346;&#2346;&#2337;&#2364;&#2368; &#2324;&#2352; &#2360;&#2381;&#2325;&#2375;&#2354;&#2367;&#2306;&#2327; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2344;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?</p><p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Cheilosis &#2330;&#2375;&#2311;&#2354;&#2379;&#2360;&#2367;&#2360;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Cheilosis</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2330;&#2375;&#2311;&#2354;&#2379;&#2360;&#2367;&#2360;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Psoriasis &#2360;&#2379;&#2352;&#2366;&#2351;&#2360;&#2367;&#2360;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Psoriasis</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2379;&#2352;&#2366;&#2351;&#2360;&#2367;&#2360;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Urticaria &#2346;&#2367;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2368;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Urticaria</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2346;&#2367;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2368;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Atopic dermatitis &#2320;&#2335;&#2379;&#2346;&#2367;&#2325; &#2337;&#2352;&#2350;&#2376;&#2335;&#2367;&#2335;&#2367;&#2360;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Atopic dermatitis</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2320;&#2335;&#2379;&#2346;&#2367;&#2325; &#2337;&#2352;&#2350;&#2376;&#2335;&#2367;&#2335;&#2367;&#2360;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>The correct answer is Cheilosis. This condition, also known as angular cheilitis, is caused by a deficiency of vitamin B2 (riboflavin) and leads to painful cracks, redness, and scaling at the corners of the mouth.</p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>",
