      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "38e963772805-q4",
      "number": 4,
      "question": "Nuts, vegetable oil and fish are rich sources of _____. &#2350;&#2375;&#2357;&#2366;, &#2357;&#2344;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2340;&#2367; &#2340;&#2375;&#2354; &#2324;&#2352; &#2350;&#2331;&#2354;&#2368; _____ &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2350;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343; &#2360;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Nuts, vegetable oil and fish are rich sources of _____.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2350;&#2375;&#2357;&#2366;, &#2357;&#2344;&#2360;&#2381;&#2346;&#2340;&#2367; &#2340;&#2375;&#2354; &#2324;&#2352; &#2350;&#2331;&#2354;&#2368; _____ &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2350;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343; &#2360;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Omega-3 &#2323;&#2350;&#2375;&#2327;&#2366; 3",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Omega-3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2323;&#2350;&#2375;&#2327;&#2366; 3</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "carbohydrates &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2348;&#2379;&#2361;&#2366;&#2311;&#2337;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2335;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">carbohydrates</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2348;&#2379;&#2361;&#2366;&#2311;&#2337;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2335;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "minerals &#2326;&#2344;&#2367;&#2332;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">minerals</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2326;&#2344;&#2367;&#2332;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "vitamins &#2357;&#2367;&#2335;&#2366;&#2350;&#2367;&#2344;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">vitamins</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2367;&#2335;&#2366;&#2350;&#2367;&#2344;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>Foods that are high in <b>Omega-3</b> fatty acids include fish, vegetable oils, nuts like walnuts, flax seeds, flaxseed oil, and leafy vegetables.</p>",
