    },
    {
      "id": "38e963772805-q5",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "Which of the following statements about nutrients are correct? Statement A: C, H, O, N, P and K are macro nutrients. Statement B: Fe, Mn, Ni, Co and Mo are micronutrients. Statement C: Micronutrients are not essential for our body. &#2346;&#2379;&#2359;&#2325; &#2340;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2352;&#2375; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;? &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; A: C, H, O, N, P &#2324;&#2352; K &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2370;&#2354; &#2346;&#2379;&#2359;&#2325; &#2340;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; B: Fe, Mn, Ni, Co &#2324;&#2352; Mo &#2360;&#2370;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2381;&#2350; &#2346;&#2379;&#2359;&#2325; &#2340;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; C: &#2360;&#2370;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2381;&#2350; &#2346;&#2379;&#2359;&#2325; &#2340;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357; &#2361;&#2350;&#2366;&#2352;&#2375; &#2358;&#2352;&#2368;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2310;&#2357;&#2358;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which of the following statements about nutrients are correct?</p><p>Statement A: C, H, O, N, P and K are macro nutrients.</p><p>Statement B: Fe, Mn, Ni, Co and Mo are micronutrients.</p><p>Statement C: Micronutrients are not essential for our body.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2346;&#2379;&#2359;&#2325; &#2340;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2352;&#2375; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?</p><p>&#2325;&#2341;&#2344; A: C, H, O, N, P &#2324;&#2352; K &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2370;&#2354; &#2346;&#2379;&#2359;&#2325; &#2340;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</p><p>&#2325;&#2341;&#2344; B: Fe, Mn, Ni, Co &#2324;&#2352; Mo &#2360;&#2370;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2381;&#2350; &#2346;&#2379;&#2359;&#2325; &#2340;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</p><p>&#2325;&#2341;&#2344; C: &#2360;&#2370;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2381;&#2350; &#2346;&#2379;&#2359;&#2325; &#2340;&#2340;&#2381;&#2357; &#2361;&#2350;&#2366;&#2352;&#2375; &#2358;&#2352;&#2368;&#2352; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2310;&#2357;&#2358;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "All statements A, B and C &#2360;&#2349;&#2368; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; A, B &#2324;&#2352; C",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">All statements A, B and C</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2349;&#2368; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; A, B &#2324;&#2352; C</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Only statements B and C &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; B &#2324;&#2352; C",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Only statements B and C</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; B &#2324;&#2352; C</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Only statements A and B &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; A &#2324;&#2352; B",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Only statements A and B</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; A &#2324;&#2352; B</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Only statements A and C &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; A &#2324;&#2352; C",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Only statements A and C</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; A &#2324;&#2352; C</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>&bull; Micronutrients are essential; hence Statement C is incorrect.</p><p>&bull; Macronutrients are the nutrients required by the body in large amounts for energy and growth.</p><p>&bull; Micronutrients are the nutrients needed by the body in small amounts for proper functioning of enzymes, hormones, and other body processes.</p>",
