      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "38e963772805-q6",
      "number": 6,
      "question": "What are the five Fs of indirect transmission? &#2309;&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359; &#2360;&#2306;&#2330;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2366;&#2305;&#2330; F &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What are the five Fs of indirect transmission?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2309;&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359; &#2360;&#2306;&#2330;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2375; &#2346;&#2366;&#2305;&#2330; F &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;?</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Flies, fingers, fomites, food and fluid &#2350;&#2325;&#2381;&#2326;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2305;, &#2313;&#2306;&#2327;&#2354;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2305;, &#2347;&#2379;&#2350;&#2366;&#2311;&#2335;&#2381;&#2360;, &#2349;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344; &#2324;&#2352; &#2340;&#2352;&#2354; &#2346;&#2342;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Flies, fingers, fomites, food and fluid</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2325;&#2381;&#2326;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2305;, &#2313;&#2306;&#2327;&#2354;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2305;, &#2347;&#2379;&#2350;&#2366;&#2311;&#2335;&#2381;&#2360;, &#2349;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344; &#2324;&#2352; &#2340;&#2352;&#2354; &#2346;&#2342;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Fruit, fingers, flu, food and fluid &#2347;&#2354;, &#2313;&#2306;&#2327;&#2354;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2305;, &#2347;&#2381;&#2354;&#2370;, &#2349;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344; &#2324;&#2352; &#2340;&#2352;&#2354; &#2346;&#2342;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Fruit, fingers, flu, food and fluid</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2347;&#2354;, &#2313;&#2306;&#2327;&#2354;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2305;, &#2347;&#2381;&#2354;&#2370;, &#2349;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344; &#2324;&#2352; &#2340;&#2352;&#2354; &#2346;&#2342;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Flies, fingers, friends, food and fruit &#2350;&#2325;&#2381;&#2326;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2305;, &#2313;&#2306;&#2327;&#2354;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2305;, &#2342;&#2379;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;, &#2349;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344; &#2324;&#2352; &#2347;&#2354;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Flies, fingers, friends, food and fruit</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2325;&#2381;&#2326;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2305;, &#2313;&#2306;&#2327;&#2354;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2305;, &#2342;&#2379;&#2360;&#2381;&#2340;, &#2349;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344; &#2324;&#2352; &#2347;&#2354;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Flies, fingers, fomites, food and fruit &#2350;&#2325;&#2381;&#2326;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2305;, &#2313;&#2306;&#2327;&#2354;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2305;, &#2347;&#2379;&#2350;&#2366;&#2311;&#2335;&#2381;&#2360;, &#2349;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344; &#2324;&#2352; &#2347;&#2354;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Flies, fingers, fomites, food and fruit</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2350;&#2325;&#2381;&#2326;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2305;, &#2313;&#2306;&#2327;&#2354;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2305;, &#2347;&#2379;&#2350;&#2366;&#2311;&#2335;&#2381;&#2360;, &#2349;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344; &#2324;&#2352; &#2347;&#2354;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>In epidemiology, the five Fs represent the primary routes of indirect disease transmission. These include: Flies (insects that transport pathogens), Fingers (contaminated hands), Fomites (inanimate objects carrying pathogens), Food (contaminated food items), and Fluid (contaminated water or other liquids). This concept is fundamental in understanding disease transmission and implementing preventive measures.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "38e963772805-q7",
      "number": 7,
      "question": "Which of the following options is correct regarding sexually transmitted disease (STD)? Statement A: Sexually transmitted diseases (STDs) are infections transmitted from an infected person to an uninfected person through sexual contact. Statement B: HIV, HPV and Hepatitis B virus is responsible for STD. &#2351;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2306;&#2330;&#2366;&#2352;&#2367;&#2340; &#2352;&#2379;&#2327; (STD) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2366;/&#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;/&#2361;&#2376;&#2306;? &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; A: &#2351;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2306;&#2330;&#2366;&#2352;&#2367;&#2340; &#2352;&#2379;&#2327; (STD) &#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2306;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2367;&#2340; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367; &#2360;&#2375; &#2319;&#2325; &#2309;&#2360;&#2306;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2367;&#2340; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2379; &#2351;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2306;&#2346;&#2352;&#2381;&#2325; &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2366;&#2343;&#2381;&#2351;&#2350; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2330;&#2366;&#2352;&#2367;&#2340; &#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2306;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2339; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; B: STD &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; HIV, HPV &#2324;&#2352; &#2361;&#2375;&#2346;&#2375;&#2335;&#2366;&#2311;&#2335;&#2367;&#2360; B &#2357;&#2366;&#2351;&#2352;&#2360; &#2332;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2350;&#2375;&#2342;&#2366;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which of the following options is correct regarding sexually transmitted disease (STD)?</p><p>Statement A: Sexually transmitted diseases (STDs) are infections transmitted from an infected person to an uninfected person through sexual contact.</p><p>Statement B: HIV, HPV and Hepatitis B virus is responsible for STD.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2306;&#2330;&#2366;&#2352;&#2367;&#2340; &#2352;&#2379;&#2327; (STD) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2366;/&#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;/&#2361;&#2376;&#2306;?</p><p><b>&#2325;&#2341;&#2344; A:</b> &#2351;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2306;&#2330;&#2366;&#2352;&#2367;&#2340; &#2352;&#2379;&#2327; (STD) &#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2306;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2367;&#2340; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367; &#2360;&#2375; &#2319;&#2325; &#2309;&#2360;&#2306;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2367;&#2340; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367; &#2325;&#2379; &#2351;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2306;&#2346;&#2352;&#2381;&#2325; &#2325;&#2375; &#2350;&#2366;&#2343;&#2381;&#2351;&#2350; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2330;&#2366;&#2352;&#2367;&#2340; &#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2306;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2339; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</p><p><b>&#2325;&#2341;&#2344;</b> <b>B:</b> STD &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; HIV, HPV &#2324;&#2352; &#2361;&#2375;&#2346;&#2375;&#2335;&#2366;&#2311;&#2335;&#2367;&#2360; B &#2357;&#2366;&#2351;&#2352;&#2360; &#2332;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2350;&#2375;&#2342;&#2366;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Both Statements A and B incorrect &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; A &#2324;&#2352; B &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2327;&#2354;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Both Statements A and B incorrect</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2341;&#2344; A &#2324;&#2352; B &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2327;&#2354;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Only Statement B is correct &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; B &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Only Statement B is correct</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; B &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Both Statements A and B correct &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; A &#2324;&#2352; B &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Both Statements A and B correct</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2341;&#2344; A &#2324;&#2352; B &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Only Statement A is correct &#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; A &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Only Statement A is correct</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2325;&#2375;&#2357;&#2354; &#2325;&#2341;&#2344; A &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>Sexually transmitted diseases (STDs) are infections transmitted from an infected person to an uninfected person through sexual contact. STDs can be caused by bacteria, viruses, or parasites. Examples include gonorrhea, genital herpes, human papilloma virus infection, HIV/AIDS, chlamydia, and syphilis.</p>",
