      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "38e963772805-q8",
      "number": 8,
      "question": "Which of the following is a rare group of genetic disorders caused by mutations of certain genes affecting the colour (pigmentation) of the skin, hair and eyes? &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2310;&#2344;&#2369;&#2357;&#2306;&#2358;&#2367;&#2325; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2342;&#2369;&#2352;&#2381;&#2354;&#2349; &#2360;&#2350;&#2370;&#2361; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2379; &#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2330;&#2366;, &#2348;&#2366;&#2354; &#2324;&#2352; &#2310;&#2306;&#2326;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2306;&#2327; (&#2352;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325;&#2340;&#2366;) &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2349;&#2366;&#2357;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2375; &#2325;&#2369;&#2331; &#2332;&#2368;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2313;&#2340;&#2381;&#2346;&#2352;&#2367;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which of the following is a rare group of genetic disorders caused by mutations of certain genes affecting the colour (pigmentation) of the skin, hair and eyes?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2310;&#2344;&#2369;&#2357;&#2306;&#2358;&#2367;&#2325; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2342;&#2369;&#2352;&#2381;&#2354;&#2349; &#2360;&#2350;&#2370;&#2361; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2379; &#2340;&#2381;&#2357;&#2330;&#2366;, &#2348;&#2366;&#2354; &#2324;&#2352; &#2310;&#2306;&#2326;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2352;&#2306;&#2327; (&#2352;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325;&#2340;&#2366;) &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2349;&#2366;&#2357;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2375; &#2325;&#2369;&#2331; &#2332;&#2368;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2313;&#2340;&#2381;&#2346;&#2352;&#2367;&#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Alkaptonuria &#2309;&#2354;&#2381;&#2325;&#2366;&#2346;&#2381;&#2335;&#2379;&#2344;&#2381;&#2351;&#2370;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Alkaptonuria</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2309;&#2354;&#2381;&#2325;&#2366;&#2346;&#2381;&#2335;&#2379;&#2344;&#2381;&#2351;&#2370;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Alagille syndrome &#2309;&#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2367;&#2354; &#2360;&#2367;&#2306;&#2337;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2350;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Alagille syndrome</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2309;&#2354;&#2366;&#2327;&#2367;&#2354; &#2360;&#2367;&#2306;&#2337;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2350;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Albinism &#2352;&#2306;&#2327;&#2361;&#2368;&#2344;&#2340;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Albinism</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2352;&#2306;&#2327;&#2361;&#2368;&#2344;&#2340;&#2366;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Angelman syndrome &#2319;&#2306;&#2332;&#2354;&#2350;&#2376;&#2344; &#2360;&#2367;&#2306;&#2337;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2350;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Angelman syndrome</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2319;&#2306;&#2332;&#2354;&#2350;&#2376;&#2344; &#2360;&#2367;&#2306;&#2337;&#2381;&#2352;&#2379;&#2350;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>&bull; <b>Albinism</b> is a rare genetic disorder caused by mutations in genes that affect the <b>production of melanin</b>, the pigment responsible for the color of the skin, hair, and eyes.</p><p>&bull; Individuals with albinism have little to no melanin, resulting in <b>pale skin, white or light-colored hair</b>, and often <b>vision problems</b> due to a lack of pigmentation in the eyes.</p><p><b>Other Options Explained:</b></p><p>&bull; <b>Alkaptonuria</b>: A rare inherited disorder that leads to the buildup of homogentisic acid in the body, causing <b>darkening of the urine</b> and eventually leading to <b>arthritis</b> and other symptoms. It does not affect pigmentation.</p><p>&bull; <b>Alagille syndrome</b>: A genetic disorder that affects several parts of the body, especially the <b>liver, heart, and skeleton</b>, but does not primarily affect pigmentation.</p><p>&bull; <b>Angelman syndrome</b>: A neurogenetic disorder characterized by developmental delay, speech impairment, movement or balance disorders, and sometimes seizures. It is not related to pigmentation.</p><p><b>Further Insight:</b></p><p>&bull; <b>Types of Albinism</b>: There are different forms, including <b>ocular albinism</b> (affecting the eyes), <b>cutaneous albinism</b> (affecting skin and hair), and <b>oculocutaneous albinism</b> (affecting both).</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "38e963772805-q9",
      "number": 9,
      "question": "Which of the following is a disease caused by drinking contaminated water? &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2366; &#2352;&#2379;&#2327; &#2342;&#2370;&#2359;&#2367;&#2340; &#2332;&#2354; &#2346;&#2368;&#2344;&#2375; &#2360;&#2375; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which of the following is a disease caused by drinking contaminated water?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344;-&#2360;&#2366; &#2352;&#2379;&#2327; &#2342;&#2370;&#2359;&#2367;&#2340; &#2332;&#2354; &#2346;&#2368;&#2344;&#2375; &#2360;&#2375; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Scurvy &#2360;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2357;&#2368;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Scurvy</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2381;&#2325;&#2352;&#2381;&#2357;&#2368;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Cholera &#2361;&#2376;&#2332;&#2364;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Cholera</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2361;&#2376;&#2332;&#2364;&#2366;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Rickets &#2352;&#2367;&#2325;&#2375;&#2335;&#2381;&#2360;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Rickets</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2352;&#2367;&#2325;&#2375;&#2335;&#2381;&#2360;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Anaemia &#2352;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2344;&#2381;&#2351;&#2370;&#2344;&#2340;&#2366;/&#2309;&#2352;&#2325;&#2381;&#8205;&#2340;&#2340;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Anaemia</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2352;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2344;&#2381;&#2351;&#2370;&#2344;&#2340;&#2366;/&#2309;&#2352;&#2325;&#2381;&#8205;&#2340;&#2340;&#2366;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p>Cholera is an acute diarrheal illness caused by infection of the intestine with Vibrio cholera bacteria. <b>People can get sick when they swallow food or water contaminated with cholera bacteria.</b> The infection is often mild or without symptoms, but can sometimes be severe and life-threatening.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "38e963772805-q10",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "Which of the following is another name for Vitamin C? &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2357;&#2367;&#2335;&#2366;&#2350;&#2367;&#2344; &#2360;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2366; &#2344;&#2366;&#2350; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which of the following is another name for Vitamin C?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2357;&#2367;&#2335;&#2366;&#2350;&#2367;&#2344; &#2360;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2366; &#2344;&#2366;&#2350; &#2361;&#2376;?</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Pyridoxine &#2326;&#2364;&#2340;&#2350;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Pyridoxine</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2326;&#2364;&#2340;&#2350;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Pyridoxal &#2346;&#2366;&#2311;&#2352;&#2367;&#2337;&#2379;&#2325;&#2381;&#2360;&#2354;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Pyridoxal</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2346;&#2366;&#2311;&#2352;&#2367;&#2337;&#2379;&#2325;&#2381;&#2360;&#2354;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Pyridoxamine &#2346;&#2366;&#2311;&#2352;&#2367;&#2337;&#2379;&#2325;&#2381;&#2360;&#2366;&#2350;&#2366;&#2311;&#2344;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Pyridoxamine</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2346;&#2366;&#2311;&#2352;&#2367;&#2337;&#2379;&#2325;&#2381;&#2360;&#2366;&#2350;&#2366;&#2311;&#2344;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Ascorbic acid &#2319;&#2360;&#2381;&#2325;&#2377;&#2352;&#2381;&#2348;&#2367;&#2325; &#2309;&#2350;&#2381;&#2354;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Ascorbic acid</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2319;&#2360;&#2381;&#2325;&#2377;&#2352;&#2381;&#2348;&#2367;&#2325; &#2309;&#2350;&#2381;&#2354;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>Vitamin C, essential for immune function and collagen production, is scientifically known as ascorbic acid.</p>",
